{"seq":3,"slug":"motor-carrier-qualification-contract","title":"集卡承运商资质、运力池与短驳合同条款的工程化建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/port-drayage-truck-appointment-container-dispatch-system/drayage-network-operating-model/motor-carrier-qualification-contract","wordCount":3140,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"集卡承运商资质-运力池与短驳合同条款的工程化建模\">集卡承运商资质、运力池与短驳合同条款的工程化建模</h1><p>凌晨两点，调度员接到一票必须在早班窗口前送达的进口重箱，系统里挂了 12 家车队，真正能接单的只有 3 家：两家没有该码头的闸口准入权限，一家在上一单里撞了底盘车的归还时限。车队名录不是通讯录，而是一份带<strong>有效期、约束条件和衰减率</strong>的运力资产。本文要把「谁有资格拉我的箱」「他此刻还剩多少可调度运力」「我该怎么和他签约并追责」翻译成可校验、可监控、可自动执行的数据结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-资质-运力-合同是三条独立的可校验链\">核心概念：资质、运力、合同是三条独立的可校验链</h2><p>「这家车队靠不靠谱」在业务上是一个笼统判断，在系统里必须拆成三条<strong>证伪方式完全不同</strong>的链：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>资质链（Qualification）</strong>：承运商是否有法定经营主体资格、足额保险、以及任一码头/场站的设施准入权限。它有<strong>外部权威签发物</strong>（联邦注册号、保险凭证、码头注册记录）且带<strong>到期日</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>运力链（Capacity）</strong>：此刻能实际投入本票业务的运力，由在册车辆数、司机在岗数、当前占用率和接单偏好决定。它<strong>随时间剧烈波动</strong>且无权威签发物，只能靠履约历史估计。</li>\n<li><strong>合同链（Contract）</strong>：约定的费率结构、附加费口径、责任分配与争议路径。它<strong>一旦签订即冻结</strong>，改版需显式生效日，且必须能被规则引擎重算。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三条链最容易出的错，是把它们揉成一个「供应商评分」。评分看起来简洁，却把「本月保险到期」这种硬性阻断降权成了减分项——而断保当天该车队本就不该再被派单，无论历史评分多高。正确的方向是：资质做<strong>布尔门控</strong>（不通过即不可派），运力做<strong>连续权重</strong>（用于排序），合同做<strong>版本化契约</strong>（用于计价与追责）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>链</th>\n<th>数据来源</th>\n<th>更新频率</th>\n<th>失效时系统行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>资质 Qualification</td>\n<td>FMCSA 注册库、保险凭证、码头准入注册</td>\n<td>事件驱动（到期/变更）</td>\n<td>硬阻断派单，不可覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运力 Capacity</td>\n<td>车队 API、司机 App 上报、历史接单率</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n<td>降低权重、触发兜派</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合同 Contract</td>\n<td>双方签署的费率表与条款附件</td>\n<td>版本化，显式生效日</td>\n<td>换版本重算，历史单不回溯</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[新承运商加入] --&gt; B{法定主体校验&lt;br/&gt;DOT/MC 号 + BOC-3}&#10;  B --&gt;|不通过| X[拒绝入池]&#10;  B --&gt;|通过| C{保险校验&lt;br/&gt;MCS-90 + 限额}&#10;  C --&gt;|不足/断保| X&#10;  C --&gt;|通过| D{设施准入&lt;br/&gt;码头注册 + TWIC}&#10;  D --&gt;|不通过| E[仅入非受限池]&#10;  D --&gt;|通过| F[进入运力池]&#10;  F --&gt; G[合同签署&lt;br/&gt;费率表 + 条款版本]&#10;  G --&gt; H[派单排序]&#10;  H --&gt; I{承运商接受?}&#10;  I --&gt;|否| J[兜派下一档位]&#10;  J --&gt; I&#10;  I --&gt;|是| K[履约记录回流]&#10;  K --&gt; F\">graph TD\n  A[新承运商加入] --&gt; B{法定主体校验&lt;br/&gt;DOT/MC 号 + BOC-3}\n  B --&gt;|不通过| X[拒绝入池]\n  B --&gt;|通过| C{保险校验&lt;br/&gt;MCS-90 + 限额}\n  C --&gt;|不足/断保| X\n  C --&gt;|通过| D{设施准入&lt;br/&gt;码头注册 + TWIC}\n  D --&gt;|不通过| E[仅入非受限池]\n  D --&gt;|通过| F[进入运力池]\n  F --&gt; G[合同签署&lt;br/&gt;费率表 + 条款版本]\n  G --&gt; H[派单排序]\n  H --&gt; I{承运商接受?}\n  I --&gt;|否| J[兜派下一档位]\n  J --&gt; I\n  I --&gt;|是| K[履约记录回流]\n  K --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"承运商资质的三层校验-法定主体-安全绩效与设施准入\">承运商资质的三层校验：法定主体、安全绩效与设施准入</h2><p>资质校验第一层是<strong>法定经营主体资格</strong>。美国境内做跨州集卡承运的 for-hire 车队须持有 FMCSA 核发的 USDOT 号，从事有偿运输还须持有 MC 号（operating authority）。为了让收货人能在各州起诉一家在外州注册的车队，49 CFR Part 366 要求承运人提交 <strong>BOC-3 表格</strong>，为全美 48 个相邻州加哥伦比亚特区指定送达代理人（process agent）——它决定了「出了事故能不能在美国境内送达传票」。</p>\n<p>第二层是<strong>财务责任证明</strong>。49 CFR 387.9 规定，从事 for-hire 跨州运输、车辆总重额定值 10,001 磅及以上、载运非危险性普通货物的承运人，最低公共责任险限额为 <strong>75 万美元</strong>，危险品类别另有更高限额。证明以 <strong>MCS-90 保险背书</strong>或 <strong>MCS-82 担保证明</strong>形式存在，须保存在承运人主要营业地且属<strong>公开信息</strong>。系统要内建两条硬约束：保单的<strong>35 天注销预告期</strong>（49 CFR 387.7(b)）意味着保险不是瞬间失效，收到注销通知即须预警；限额不足的承运商<strong>不得</strong>被派单，这是法定门槛而非风控偏好。第三层是<strong>设施准入</strong>，最容易低估，因为它由码头、铁路场站或堆场自行管理。美西两港（洛杉矶/长滩）要求进入码头的集卡在<strong>港口集卡注册库</strong>（Drayage Truck Registry）登记并满足清洁空气行动计划下的排放要求，未登记车辆无论车队资质多好都无法过闸；人身准入方面还有 TSA 核发的 <strong>TWIC</strong>，用于海事设施的安全管制区域。</p>\n<p>这三层叠加后的通配能力，可以形式化为一个门控函数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Eligible</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>Authority</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><mtext>Insurance</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><munder><mo>⋀</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>Facilities</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><mtext>Access</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Eligible}(c,\\,t) = \\text{Authority}(c) \\wedge \\text{Insurance}(c,\\,t) \\wedge \\bigwedge_{f \\in \\text{Facilities}(c)} \\text{Access}(c,\\,f,\\,t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Eligible</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Authority</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Insurance</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Facilities</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">⋀</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Access</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意每个谓词都带时间下标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>——资质是时间的函数而非静态属性，这正是「供应商评分」模型无法表达的部分。关于这些主体在合同链与实际操作链上的分工，可对照同章的 <a href=\"drayage-network-topology-actors\">短驳网络拓扑与参与方角色</a> 一起理解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"运力池建模-车队档位-兜派顺序与承运商分层\">运力池建模：车队档位、兜派顺序与承运商分层</h2><p>资质回答「能不能拉」，运力池回答「谁来拉、按什么顺序问」。成熟的车队 TMS 几乎都采用<strong>分层派单</strong>（tiered dispatch）而非全局竞价：把承运商划入若干档位，同一票货先问第一档，无人接受再下沉。分层依据混合三个维度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>合同化程度</strong>：签了年度框架协议、承诺最低量的核心承运商通常在第一档，用较高费率换取优先派单权。</li>\n<li><strong>时窗能力</strong>：是否持有该码头特定窗口的预约配额。码头预约是受约束的时间配额资源（详见 <a href=\"../terminal-appointment-window-scheduling/appointment-window-quota-model\">码头预约时段与配额模型</a>），无对应配额的车队即便车辆空闲也无法执行。</li>\n<li><strong>履约可靠性</strong>：历史准时率、放空率、争议率，用于档内排序而非档位划分。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>运力池的<strong>可用容量</strong>不是「在册车辆数」的简单求和。一台车可能在维修、可能正在执行上一单、可能因底盘车未归还而无法装载重箱。工程上更实用的是按车队聚合一个<strong>有效运力</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mtext>pe</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mtext>cap</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{eff}} = \\sum_{i} \\min\\!\\left(\\text{pe}_i,\\ \\text{cap}_i\\right) \\cdot a_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pe</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cap</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>pe</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{pe}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6747em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pe</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是车队 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 承诺的可用车辆数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>cap</mtext><mo>∗</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cap}*i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6597em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cap</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 是它当前实际可用数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是历史接受率——它把「名义上挂了很多家」折算成「实际上叫得动多少家」。假设各承运商独立决策，一票货能被接下的概率是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>fill</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P*{\\text{fill}} = 1 - \\prod_{i=1}^{n}(1 - a_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fill</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.104em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这条式子给出反直觉的结论：单家接受率只有 0.2 时，池子从 3 家扩到 6 家，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>fill</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{fill}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fill</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从 0.49 升到 0.74；而从 6 家扩到 12 家只再升到 0.93——<strong>填单能力对「家数」边际递减</strong>。有效手段是提高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，而非无限扩容名录；运力池治理的核心指标因此是<strong>加权有效运力</strong>而非挂牌车队数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"短驳合同条款的可执行化-费率-附加费与责任分配\">短驳合同条款的可执行化：费率、附加费与责任分配</h2><p>短驳合同的费率结构是<strong>基础运价 + 一堆条件触发项</strong>，每项都有自己的计费口径。工程上必须先分清哪些硬编码、哪些可配置。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条款类别</th>\n<th>典型内容</th>\n<th>建模要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础运价</td>\n<td>按移动类型（进口提重/出口送重/空箱回场）与距离计费</td>\n<td>移动类型是关键分片键，须与箱流状态模型对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等待与滞留</td>\n<td>超过约定免费等待时间后按小时计等待费</td>\n<td>需可核验的到达/离场时间戳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双重运输激励</td>\n<td>同趟完成「送重 + 提空」时给予折扣</td>\n<td>折扣条件须能被状态机自动判定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>附加费转嫁</td>\n<td>清洁卡车基金费、交通缓解费、底盘车使用费</td>\n<td>决定由货主、货代还是车队承担</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>责任与保险</td>\n<td>货损责任、底盘车损坏责任、事故连带</td>\n<td>指回 UIIA 与 MCS-90 的责任框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>争议路径</td>\n<td>账单争议时限、仲裁机构、证据要求</td>\n<td>需时限状态机，不可用邮件往来代替</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>设备交换责任</strong>是短驳合同最特殊的一块，因为底盘车通常既不属车队也不属货主，而属船公司或租赁商。北美 95% 的设备交换都在 <strong>UIIA</strong>（Uniform Intermodal Interchange and Facilities Access Agreement）这一份标准化行业合同下管理，由北美多式联运协会 IANA 运营，覆盖约 13,000 家多式联运卡车公司。它把「每换一家设备提供方就重签一份协议」变成一份协议覆盖多方，并规定参与承运商须以 ACORD 22 保险凭证提交保险要件；因 per diem、维修保养、设备使用/租赁费产生的发票争议，走完约定程序后可提交 <strong>UIIA 约束性仲裁</strong>。底盘车计费与争议的数据结构应当<strong>可对接 UIIA 口径</strong>，而非自创字段。</p>\n<p><strong>附加费转嫁</strong>是需要显式建模的合规点。美西两港的清洁卡车基金费（Clean Truck Fund Rate, CTF）对非豁免卡车按 <strong>每 TEU 10 美元</strong>收取、由货主或其代理承担，用于推动 2035 年零排放车队转型；零排放卡车豁免，洛杉矶港另对 2022 年底前完成注册的低氮氧化物卡车给予豁免至 <strong>2027 年 12 月 31 日</strong>，自 2022 年 4 月 1 日起开收，至 2024 年初累计超 1.15 亿美元，由 PortCheck 归集。与之并行的是 WCMTOA 的 OffPeak 夜间作业计划所收<strong>交通缓解费</strong>（TMF），覆盖两港 12 个集装箱码头。合同里若不写明这些费用由谁承担、按什么口径（TEU 还是箱数）计算，账单到达时就会立刻变成争议。</p>\n<h2 id=\"资质与运力的持续监控-失效-断保与自动停派\">资质与运力的持续监控：失效、断保与自动停派</h2><p>资质建模的终点不是「入池时校验一次」，而是<strong>持续监控 + 自动停派</strong>。入池校验是快照，而出事往往在快照之后：保险第七个月被注销、码头注册换车后未更新、司机 TWIC 过期。系统要把这些变化建模为<strong>状态迁移事件</strong>并绑定处置动作。必须监控的四类失效：保险断保与 35 天注销预告（收到即预警并启动续保跟进，失效日仍未续保则移出可派池）；FMCSA 安全评级与事故数据更新导致失去运营资格；加州空气资源委员会（CARB）的<strong>先进清洁车队</strong>（ACF）法规分阶段推进零排放替换，港口注册库准入标准随之收紧；以及码头注册、TWIC、驾照与医疗证明的到期日——它们应进入同一张<strong>资质到期日历</strong>。把失效与运力衰减合起来即得到派单前的<strong>实时门控</strong>：任何一票货派给某承运商前先求一次 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Eligible</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Eligible}(c,t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Eligible</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，再按档位与运力权重排序。这套门控与箱流状态机消费同一批事件——「能否派单」本质上就是「这台车与这个箱此刻在各自生命周期里处于什么状态」，其状态建模可对照 <a href=\"container-move-lifecycle-status-model\">箱流生命周期与搬移状态模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>承运商管理拆成三条独立链：<strong>资质做布尔门控、运力做连续权重、合同做版本化契约</strong>，混成一个评分会把硬性阻断降级成软性减分。</li>\n<li>资质校验三层：法定主体（USDOT/MC + BOC-3 送达代理人）、财务责任（49 CFR 387.9 的 75 万美元最低限额、MCS-90/MCS-82、35 天注销预告）与设施准入（港口集卡注册库、TWIC）。</li>\n<li>运力池容量按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>pe</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>cap</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum \\min(\\text{pe}_i, \\text{cap}_i) \\cdot a_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pe</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cap</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 折算，填单概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo>∏</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\prod(1-a_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 对家数边际递减——提高接受率比扩容名录更有效。</li>\n<li>合同把基础运价、等待费、双重运输折扣、附加费转嫁与责任条款分别建模；底盘车交换遵循 UIIA 这套覆盖约 13,000 家卡车公司的标准合同。</li>\n<li>清洁卡车基金费按每 TEU 10 美元由货主承担（零排放与部分低氮氧卡车豁免），码头交通缓解费由 OffPeak 计划归集——承担方必须在合同中事先写清。</li>\n<li>资质是时间的函数：保险注销、监管评级变化、排放法规演进与注册过期都应建模为事件并触发自动停派。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"集卡承运商资质、运力池与短驳合同条款的工程化建模","id":"集卡承运商资质-运力池与短驳合同条款的工程化建模"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：资质、运力、合同是三条独立的可校验链","id":"核心概念-资质-运力-合同是三条独立的可校验链"},{"level":2,"text":"承运商资质的三层校验：法定主体、安全绩效与设施准入","id":"承运商资质的三层校验-法定主体-安全绩效与设施准入"},{"level":2,"text":"运力池建模：车队档位、兜派顺序与承运商分层","id":"运力池建模-车队档位-兜派顺序与承运商分层"},{"level":2,"text":"短驳合同条款的可执行化：费率、附加费与责任分配","id":"短驳合同条款的可执行化-费率-附加费与责任分配"},{"level":2,"text":"资质与运力的持续监控：失效、断保与自动停派","id":"资质与运力的持续监控-失效-断保与自动停派"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"箱流生命周期与搬移状态模型：从进口放箱到空箱回场的可追踪状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/port-drayage-truck-appointment-container-dispatch-system/drayage-network-operating-model/container-move-lifecycle-status-model"},"next":{"title":"码头预约时段与配额模型：窗口资源、时间片与放号规则的抽象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/port-drayage-truck-appointment-container-dispatch-system/terminal-appointment-window-scheduling/appointment-window-quota-model"}}